## 🔧 Testing

Los widgets reutilizables deben ser fácilmente testeables:

```dart
testWidgets('PrimaryButton should call onPressed when tapped', (tester) async {
  bool wasPressed = false;
  
  await tester.pumpWidget(
    MaterialApp(
      home: PrimaryButton(
        label: 'Test',
        onPressed: () => wasPressed = true,
      ),
    ),
  );

  await tester.tap(find.text('Test'));
  expect(wasPressed, true);
});
```

